# Copy to .env (which is git-ignored) and fill in.
#
# The only secret a person has to supply is the LLM API key for the chat agent.
# scripts/local-up reads it and Helm stores it in a Kubernetes Secret. Every
# other secret (database passwords, signing keys, admin passwords, the tokens
# between the gateway and its MCP servers) is generated inside the cluster.
#
# A free Groq key: https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=
